Source: installctl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mikhail Yatsenko <mikhail.yatsenko@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkg-config, libfuse3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/yamixst/installctl

Package: installctl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libfuse3-3 (>= 3.2.0), uidmap, sudo
Recommends: apparmor
Description: Safe sandbox runner and change tracker for software installers
 installctl executes arbitrary software installers in an unprivileged sandbox
 backed by a FUSE overlay filesystem, intercepts privilege escalation and
 dangerous system commands, presents an interactive diff review, and generates
 clean uninstallation scripts.
